  "pin_numbering": "TANG_1K:PINnn means GW1NZ-1 QFN48 FPGA package pin, not header position or BL702 GPIO",
  "status": "Corrected package-pin proposal; final constraints, header mapping and hardware validation pending",
  "notes": [
    "74AHCT125 channel labels are logical terminals; map them to the exact chip or module package before wiring. Unused Y4 is unconnected.",
    "Place decoupling at the level shifter and display; verify supply capacity and do not attach an independent 5 V source while USB is powering the board.",
    "R1-R4 are active-low scan outputs, high impedance when inactive; C1-C4 and K1-K4 are pulled-up inputs.",
    "Keypad rows need the planned series resistors; their values and exact header positions belong in the final wiring diagram."
  ]
